<h1>Reset Your Password</h1>

<p>Hi {@user.first_name},</p>

<p>
  We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to create a new password:
</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a href={@url} class="button">Reset Password</a></p>

<p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>

<p><a href={@url} class="link">{@url}</a></p>

<p>This link will expire in 1 hour.</p>

<p>
  If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
</p>

<p>
  For security reasons, if you continue to receive password reset emails you didn't request, please contact our support team.
</p>
